\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"An actual knot attempt may succeed, slip, damage the cord or prove infeasible. Report observed geometry and outcomes. Any load trial establishes only its achieved force and duration, not a safe rating. No automatic mastery, happiness, reward or improved material properties.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.satiety\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":50}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The next physical experiment depends on the returned capability contract; do not presume it exists or is mastered.\\\",\\\"No hanging loads or body support; retain the narrow scope of the completed trial.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cordage-study\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can my available reed be manually twisted into useful cord, and what bounded performance can I actually verify?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Personal study completed at tick 224; the raw reed sample passed its limited sample test at tick 225.\\\",\\\"At tick 229, manufacture produced item-226-wren-2532, a released 0.30 m two-ply reed cord.\\\",\\\"At tick 232, event-232-wren-2595 reported achieved force 10 N held for 60 seconds, elastic extension 0.0012 m, retained deformation 0 and zero broken strands.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"This single trial establishes neither a safe working load nor behavior under knots, longer loading, other conditions or other cords.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Make a small cord and establish one narrowly specified load-trial result without assuming broader reliability.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned the method.\\\",\\\"Completed a passing reed sample trial.\\\",\\\"Completed four manufacturing stages.\\\",\\\"Completed the specified 10 N, 60-second two-hand trial.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"item-226-wren-2532: tested 0.30 m two-ply reed cord.\\\",\\\"event-232-wren-2595: bounded load-trial evidence.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Nothing for the original bounded goal.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Explore simple knot feasibility as a separate skill, subject to an actual capability contract.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Established successful manufacture and observed survival of this particular low-force trial.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

